{"name": "Midgardr", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras_big/6bc6e8aa0dedfaf53baf5c828b9d9d48.webp?t=1786117108\" height=\"485\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/6bc6e8aa0dedfaf53baf5c828b9d9d48.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u2726\u00a0Midgardr is a medieval board game blending strategy and storytelling, where every choice shapes your fate. <br/>It's a\u00a0solo, turn-based city builder and card game where you play on a  game board as a medieval administrator...<br/>But maybe you're not just that. And maybe the board isn't all it seems \u2060\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/24dd9afb0ea1a1723366593b15469823.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/24dd9afb0ea1a1723366593b15469823.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/24dd9afb0ea1a1723366593b15469823.mp4?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/c5971624a1d53dcbd06ee5ef04672fcb.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"423\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/cabcab796126d4a728f7585af7b9697e.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/cabcab796126d4a728f7585af7b9697e.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726\u00a0<strong>Play cards</strong> and <strong>manage resources</strong> to build your settlement and keep your people happy and thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2726\u00a0<strong>Face moral choices and unpredictable events</strong> that threaten peace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726\u00a0<strong>Choose your political allies</strong>\u00a0(<i>Curtes</i>) carefully and <strong>encounter mysterious figures</strong> offering <strong>quests</strong> that shape your destiny through <strong>branching paths</strong> and difficult decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there's more beneath the surface: as you play, you'll begin to uncover a mysterious meta-story hidden behind it all... <strong>If you're just a Duke in a board game, who's moving the pieces on the board?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/08c6a59b708c93e43be74b721b083186.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/08c6a59b708c93e43be74b721b083186.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/dc29703c357a98ed101c13dace310624.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 <strong>Buildings and Resources\u00a0</strong>\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather <strong>wood</strong>, <strong>stone</strong>, and <strong>coins</strong> to expand your village. Collect <strong>food</strong> to feed your villagers and keep them happy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"208\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9cc2b714c2bf3565a151461b4bb181e6.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9cc2b714c2bf3565a151461b4bb181e6.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your resources wisely: build <strong><i>Residential Structures</i></strong>\u00a0\u2013 like houses and manors\u00a0\u2013 to grow your population; <strong><i>Productive Buildings</i></strong>\u00a0\u2013 like farms, markets, mines, lumberjacks\u00a0\u2013 to collect resources; <strong><i>Military Structures</i></strong>\u00a0\u2013 like towers and fortress to defend.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every urban choice has lasting consequences\u2026 and your people are watching. Will they remember you as a generous ruler, or a power-hungry tyrant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/49604f96ac64c7ae99d41a5a23aaf036.mp4?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/148eb090304d07e7e76ced8ffad923f8.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 <strong>Curtes and Politics\u00a0</strong>\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2060</strong>The <i><strong>Curtes</strong></i> is the heart of your domain: your government. <br/>It\u2019s your task to <strong>assign the right characters to each role</strong> within the <i>Curtes</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/200086dc7400adf761f2efbf244c14e5.mp4?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character bring his own <strong>trait and effect</strong>: use their powers wisely to serve your strategy and try to build a politically aligned faction with similar traits to unlock powerful bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t underestimate fate: some may fall ill, or even lose their minds\u2026 shattering your careful plans in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/4f387ab233027103b72184ef9f8a4233.mp4?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/f6789944587c05ae6c2c8c564f7e1104.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 <strong>Events cards\u00a0</strong>\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your village will face <strong>strange and sudden events</strong>. A miraculous harvest: gift from the heavens or ancient curse? Knights in the woods: refugees or revenants? A strange egg: good omen or the spark of calamity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"285\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/56acb9217a95cef91128eb801e2d308d.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/56acb9217a95cef91128eb801e2d308d.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><strong>Each event demands a decision</strong>, but <strong>you won\u2019t know the outcome until you choose</strong>. What seems like a blessing may hide a curse, and what feels like a threat might bring unexpected fortune. The consequences will affect your resources and may even change the state of your village. You cannot escape fate, but you can choose how to face it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/ec5edcd0839cbfd1ca2a8c8cd2d352f0.mp4?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/04080e0c443af5e3185dbe802d17d9b0.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 <strong>Quests and Encounters\u00a0</strong>\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your reign, <strong>six mysterious figures</strong> will cross your path. Some will ask for favors, others will plant seeds of doubt, a few may try to guide\u2026 or manipulate you. It\u2019s up to you to decide whom to trust and whom to reject. But every choice comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"333\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/526944d47f037c0e5a6339b29f851781.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/526944d47f037c0e5a6339b29f851781.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the main storyline of the game, told through a series of letters. <strong>Your replies shape your path and determine your destiny, leading you toward one of several possible endings</strong>. <br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/d43b28de3552c18db556f67797e77b42.mp4?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras_big/9fbf9edc7cd2eec13f5593c4de86b4cf.webp?t=1786117108\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9fbf9edc7cd2eec13f5593c4de86b4cf.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 <strong>Quests and Encounters\u00a0</strong>\u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">lay through the demo to its very end to catch a glimpse of something the game hasn't revealed yet: a hint of another time, another place, and the sense that not everything ends when the story does. Midgardr isn't only a board game \u2014 it's a threshold between two worlds, waiting to be crossed. <strong>Play the demo now and find out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/7cdb993f68fb0e4948803eb6d1b92124.poster.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/7cdb993f68fb0e4948803eb6d1b92124.webm?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/7cdb993f68fb0e4948803eb6d1b92124.mp4?t=1786117108\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras_big/2bf7bc472db92e9d123f60d81a217676.webp?t=1786117108\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/2bf7bc472db92e9d123f60d81a217676.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras_big/9e939bc2af8a45acd62bf8c90c41530e.webp?t=1786117108\" height=\"730\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/9e939bc2af8a45acd62bf8c90c41530e.avif?t=1786117108\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A board game where you play as a Duke sent to build and protect a village at the edge of the realm. Every choice you make will shape its future. But be aware: the board itself may not be all it seems... Will your village thrive or crumble beneath truths yet unknown? Are you really just... a Duke?", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/a366e574a59f21e9bd4ae52744624b8ae17e6665/header.jpg?t=1786117108", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Choices Matter", "Card Game", "City Builder", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Choose Your Own Adventure"], "developers": "Holy Radish", "publishers": "Holy Radish", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3645410", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 April 2026 - Request Access\n\n3 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/vwCMFmKhjh4", "first_seen": 1777240800.0, "review_rank": 779}